        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions FII-SD-CFRBACY-18 18 Inch Yellow Acrylic Shower Door Pulls</b>\r\n<p>Made in the USA by the master craftsmen at First Impressions from the finest clear acrylic available. The acrylic is manufactured with UV inhibitors to prevent collor fading.  The mounting brackets come in your choice of Polished Chrome, Polished Nickel, Oil Rubbed Bronze or Satin Nickel.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions FII-SD-CFRBACY-18 Yellow Acrylic Shower Door Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Clear Yellow Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Available Finishes: 4</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNote: These acrylic shower door pulls are handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b> and <b>Acrylic Colors</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Packaged with 2 door pull handles and includes the hardware for back to back mounting on 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass shower doors. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Pair (2 Pulls)</b>\r\n</p>",
